# Trivy suppressions. One entry only; nothing else in this repository is
# excluded from a Trivy scan.
#
# KSV0125 "Restrict container images to trusted registries" fires on
# deploy/kubernetes/permissionsync.example.yaml because Trivy's built-in policy
# carries a generic default trusted-registry list that does not include GHCR.
# That image is not an accidental third-party dependency: this repository
# publishes it to ghcr.io/neteye-platform/permissionsync through its own
# release workflow, and the deployment contract requires it to be pinned by
# immutable sha256 digest. tests/oci_packaging.rs asserts both the exact GHCR
# repository and the digest pin, which is a stronger and repository-specific
# guard than the generic registry list this rule applies.
KSV0125
